concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-unfair-trading-practices-act-2026-sch-1-sec-312 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "312 Application—subscription contracts"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-312 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Sections 48B, 48E and 48F, inserted by the Competition and Consumer Amendment (Unfair Trading Practices) Act 2026, apply in relation to a contract entered into on or after the commencement of Part 3 of Schedule 1 to that Act.  (2) Sections 48B, 48E and 48F do not apply to a contract entered into before that commencement. However:  (a) if the contract is renewed, extended or otherwise continued on or after that commencement—sections 48B, 48E and 48F apply to the contract as renewed, extended or otherwise continued, on and from the day on which the renewal, extension or other continuation takes effect; or  (b) if the contract is varied on or after that commencement and paragraph (a) has not already applied in relation to the contract—sections 48B, 48E and 48F apply to the contract as  Schedule 1  Amendments" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Sections 48B, 48E and 48F, inserted by the Competition and Consumer Amendment (Unfair Trading Practices) Act 2026, apply in relation to a contract entered into on or after the commencement of Part 3 of Schedule 1 to that Act.  (2) Sections 48B, 48E and 48F do not apply to a contract entered into before that commencement. However:  (a) if the contract is renewed, extended or otherwise continued on or after that commencement—sections 48B, 48E and 48F apply to the contract as renewed, extended or otherwise continued, on and from the day on which the renewal, extension or other continuation takes effect; or  (b) if the contract is varied on or after that commencement and paragraph (a) has not already applied in relation to the contract—sections 48B, 48E and 48F apply to the contract as  Schedule 1  Amendments"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b759998828bf34d2960563f2f57c5a50bac4a99fbea51ca51850055931f7764b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "25"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-unfair-trading-practices-act-2026-sch-1-sec-312-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-unfair-trading-practices-act-2026-sch-1-sec-312-ss-2 ;
